   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expand Maternal Healthcare in Northern Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding maternal healthcare services supports mothers&apos; health, enabling them to manage conditions like hypertension and prepare for safer deliveries. It also contributes to healthier babies by providing crucial prenatal and postnatal care, such as fetal growth monitoring and early detection of complications. Your support is an investment in the resilience of the entire community, paving the way for a healthier and brighter future in Haiti.</narrative>
